= Situation =
py2exe-ing larger projekts take some time for byte compilation at all. 

= Idea =
Maybe [http://psyco.sourceforge.net psyco] will help?
as Armin Rigo writes... "Psyco is a Python extension module which can massively speed up the execution of any Python code."

= doing it =

at the top of setup.py I inserted

{{{
